Changes in v3:
- Require the id argument in /process-email and drop its fallback to
  the oldest message, as asked in "Re: [PATCH v2 2/7]
  claude/skills/process-email: Take the message to answer as an
  argument" [3]. The skill no longer queries notmuch, so
  "claude/skills/process-email: Find the oldest message with just" is
  folded into "just: Add just process-email", where the recipe's only
  caller now lives.
- Remove the skill's Modes section and its "Loop the skill" line, so
  the skill only ever processes one message, as asked in "Re: [PATCH
  v2 3/7] just: Add just process-email" [4]. 6/6 says in the skill
  that a pass sends no notification.
- Prefix error messages with "E: " in the loop and in
  get-up-to-date.sh [4]. notify's failure is not fatal, so it is
  prefixed "W: " instead; say if you want "E: " there too.
- Remove double spaces from get-up-to-date.sh comments.
